<title>FRANCE: Cuban unemployment just over seven pct - paper.</title>
<headline>Cuban unemployment just over seven pct - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cuban unemployment has hit just over seven percent of the active population, Cuba's central governor Francisco Soberon said in an interview carried in Wednesday's edition of the French daily Le Monde.</p>
<p>&quot;For the first time since the revolution, unemployment has appeared, touching a little over seven percent of the active population,&quot; Soberon told the newspaper.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
